# Allow only build and runtime files, excluding custom storage directories.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.js
!lib/
!lib/**
!public/
!public/**
!locale/
!locale/**

# Keep runtime secrets and data out even beneath an allowed directory.
**/.env*
**/data.json
**/data/
**/data-dev/
**/credentials.json
**/credentials.key
**/credentials.json.*.tmp
**/data.json.*.tmp
**/device.json
**/device.json.*.tmp
**/pomodoro.json
**/pomodoro.json.*.tmp
